{%- comment -%}
  THE PRODUCT SECTION. Stage (worlds, day/night, photos) + buy box.
  Reads the product assigned in the theme editor, falling back to the first product
  so the section still renders on a fresh store.

  Two real variants of xero-chiron drive the bundle cards:
    [0] Chiron                        $4,999.00
    [1] Chiron + 10-Year Replacement  $6,998.99   (+$1,999.99)
  store.js maps pickVariant0/1 to XERO_PRODUCT.variants[0]/[1], so the order of the
  cards below must match the order of the variants on the product. There is one add-on,
  the spare wireless key; store.js maps toggleKey to XERO_ADDONS[0].
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign product = all_products[section.settings.product] | default: product -%}

<script>
  window.XERO_PRODUCT = {{ product | json }};
  window.XERO_ADDONS = [
    {%- assign key = all_products[section.settings.addon_key] -%}
    {%- if key != blank -%}{ "id": {{ key.variants.first.id }}, "title": {{ key.title | json }}, "price": {{ key.price }}, "handle": {{ key.handle | json }} }{%- endif -%}
  ];
  window.XERO_FINANCE = {{ section.settings.finance_line | json }};
</script>

<section data-m="hero" data-sec="hero" style="position:relative;width:100%;height:100vh;min-height:44rem;overflow:hidden;background:var(--pg);">


